<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71706" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύ̆λ-ῐνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of wood, wooden,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεῖχος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					3.38
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόμος, οἰκίαι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
				3.49
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.108
			</span></i>, etc. ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ξ. καρπός</span>
			produce <i>of trees,</i> i. e. fruit, wine, or oil, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξηρός</span> (q.v.), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Criti.</u>
				115b
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				55.13
			</span></i> (Telmessus, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				15.1.20
			</span></i> : pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξ. καρποί,</span> opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιτικοί,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				5.4.2
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				3.63
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				3.78d
			</span></i> ; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ Δημήτριος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.2492.19
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύλιναι ὦναι,</span> opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιτηραί,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				2554.17
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Magn.
			</span></i> Mae., <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>) ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τομὰ
				ἁ ξυλίνα</span> cutting <i>of timber,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				42(1).76.9
			</span></i> (Epid., <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph., <i>wooden,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοῦς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					11.275
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Apollon.
			</span></i> Gramm.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				255
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Pall.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύλινον, τό,</span>
			<i>writing-tablet,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξ. πύξινον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PGrenf.</u>
					1.14.12
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>of cotton,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Si.</u>
				22.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				19.14
			</span></i>.</div>
